      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Nada roda on-prem, ent\u00e3o n\u00e3o prometa soberania de dado; usam IA o Copilot do Cosmos e o rascunho de pol\u00edtica do Charter; Meridian, Scaffold e Signal n\u00e3o usam."
    },
    {
      "id": "product_catalogo_precos",
